pyELK adds Java-free canonical JSON expectations, feature fixtures, provenance, and
verification reports beside the unmodified ELK resources. Those additions are licensed
under pyELK's Apache-2.0 licence. No upstream ELK resource was edited.

The development-only generator uses ELK 0.6.0 and its original test loaders through pinned
Maven artifacts. Neither those artifacts nor any generated Java class/JAR are committed or
distributed with pyELK.
